 "remarks": "Your Private Cranbury Retreat Awaits...Step into extraordinary living at 146 Partrick, where timeless traditional grace meets effortless resort-style living. Located in Norwalk's coveted Cranbury neighborhood near the Westport border, this impressive 5 bedroom, 4 full bath home finished on 3 levels spans over 4500SqFt offering the perfect blend of generous scale and everyday ease. From the moment you arrive, a dramatic two-story foyer welcomes you, setting the stage w/ soaring ceilings and walls of windows that flood the home w/ sunlight. Large open chef kitchen shines w/ new state-of-the-art appliances & seamlessly connects dining & gathering rooms for wonderful flow & easy modern day living. Sought-after floor plan offers 2 home offices and main-level bedroom suite perfect for multi-generational living or guests. Upstairs provides 4 add'l ensuite bedrooms, including the primary bedroom suite designed w/ comfort and privacy in mind. Step outside and discover your own private vacation paradise. Secluded, level backyard is designed for unforgettable gatherings w/ heated in-ground pool, stone terraces and deck tailored for barbecues and alfresco dining under the stars. Charming covered poolside lounge provides shaded tranquility on warm sunny days and romantic nights. Effortless access to both Westport and Norwalk downtowns with premier shopping, dining and vibrant beaches are just moments from your doorstep, as are both Metro North train stations for fast & easy commute to NYC",
